^XA
^FX Backfeed before: label waits in the cutter^FS
~JSB
^FX Cutter mode. No cutter: use MMT^FS
^MMC
^FX Gap labels. Black-mark stock: use MNM^FS
^MNW
^FX Direct thermal (no ribbon)^FS
^MTD
^FX Print and feed speed, inches/second^FS
^PR6,6
^FX Darkness 0-30: adjust for your stock^FS
~SD10
^FX Front-panel passcode (optional). Use your own^FS
^KP8888
^FX Save it all to the printer's memory^FS
^JUS
^FO30,30^A0N,40,40^FDPrinter configured^FS
^XZ
